{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791007680, "covers_from": "2026-10-03T06:08:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-03T06:09:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791007740, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-03T06:08:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 46915, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "您好！我是個職業遊覽車司機，主要是服務外國旅遊團為主、遊覽車在台北市很難找到臨時停靠及停車的問題", "display_name": "中山代表 周鴻儒", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T06:08:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15620, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北車站的遊民數量已經到了影響環境整潔和市容的程度了😭每次經過都要驚訝一次，但似乎無法條可約束", "display_name": "中正代表 墨霏", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T06:08:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 966, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望台北市快點回到乾淨的狀態，垃圾桶快回來，有正常排班的人員整理，蟑螂老鼠太多了，好丟臉！", "display_name": "中山代表 No.966", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T06:08:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16305, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "人行道導盲磚舖設不當，無法有效引導視障朋友。\n騎樓機車停放不整齊，對輪椅者不友善。", "display_name": "中正代表 No.16,305", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 15620, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 墨霏", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 966, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.966", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 16305, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.16,305", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 55930, "sprite_key": "leopardcat